\par
\b 12. Docker Hub Screenshots\b0\par
Open Docker Hub and verify that the four repositories contain new images:\par
\f1 taskflow-frontend\par
taskflow-user-service\par
taskflow-task-service\par
taskflow-stats-service\par
\f0\par
